  "title": "Gene dfferential activity, snATAC-seq in hepatic stellate cells, NASH vs. normal (Elison et al. 2024)",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>The plot and table display snATAC-seq gene differential activity in hepatic stellate cells from individuals with non-alcoholic steatohepatitis (NASH) vs. individuals without NASH (Weston Elison <em>et al</em>., University of California San Diego, 2024, unpublished). This work was supported by the <a href=\"https://fnih.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Foundation for the National Institutes of Health</a>.</p><p>Only genes with adjusted p-value &lt; 0.5 are shown here. Complete data are represented in the dataset <a href=\"https://cmdga.org/annotations/DSR378LUW\" target=\"_blank\">DSR378LUW</a> at the <a href=\"https://cmdga.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Common Metabolic Diseases Genome Atlas</a>.</p>",
